      "path": "docs/lean/existing-package.md",
      "currentSha256": "d37484d79b64d43891a0b28155e4ad50221fa9e882b81f770ec02e0b11a7f01e",
      "previousSha256": "1a3af319361d7aaec58dae090c6f4b7f963a05a51ef8ae14c50ff1b21aee22ac",
      "edits": [
        {
          "start": 40181,
          "previous": "Native packages have ordinary-source and reviewed installed checks for pairs, `Except`, arrays of those shapes, and plain record/variant fields in [C/C++](../evidence/native-fin-records-20261007/receipt.json), [Python and Ruby](../evidence/fin-python-ruby-20261008/receipt-v2.json), [Rust](../evidence/fin-rust-20261008/receipt-v2.json) and [.NET](../evidence/fin-dotnet-hosted-20261008/receipt.json). The C/C++ [product](../evidence/native-fin-products-20261007/receipt.json) and [Array-of-product](../evidence/native-fin-product-arrays-20261007/receipt.json) receipts record the separate structural runs. [WIT/WASI](../evidence/fin-wit-records-20261008/receipt.json) has installed record/variant checks, including records and variants inside arrays, lists, options, pairs and `Except`. Direct WIT product exports, Java/Kotlin and native PHP products/fields still need their own installed acceptance. Refined generic and recursive native types remain rejected. C/C++ callback directions and PHP-Wasm combinations are listed below.\n",
          "current": "Native packages have ordinary-source and reviewed installed checks for pairs, `Except`, arrays of those shapes, and plain record/variant fields in [C/C++](../evidence/native-fin-records-20261007/receipt.json), [Python and Ruby](../evidence/fin-python-ruby-20261008/receipt-v2.json), [Rust](../evidence/fin-rust-20261008/receipt-v2.json) and [.NET](../evidence/fin-dotnet-hosted-20261008/receipt.json). The C/C++ [product](../evidence/native-fin-products-20261007/receipt.json) and [Array-of-product](../evidence/native-fin-product-arrays-20261007/receipt.json) receipts record the separate structural runs. [WIT/WASI](../evidence/fin-wit-records-20261008/receipt.json) has installed record/variant checks, including records and variants inside arrays, lists, options, pairs and `Except`. The [hosted matrix](../evidence/fin-native-hosted-20261010/receipt.json) adds direct WIT products, Java/Kotlin, native PHP and CPAN on both source routes. Refined generic and recursive native types remain rejected. C/C++ callback directions and PHP-Wasm combinations are listed below.\n"
        }
      ]
    },
